       expanded to four lines with a bit more to say and a connecting
       guide rule instead of floating in isolation. Adds back the serif
       (Gloock, praised on E3) as a short editorial line ahead of the
       facts -- serif carries the human voice, mono carries the facts,
       instead of one or the other doing both jobs. One line of the facts
       list gets the pink touch instead of it being all-teal. */
